SYNTHETIC – a trace log in which the value of a <password> element spans lines 10–12 (US1-8):
line 10 holds the start tag and the first part of the value, line 11 only value, line 12 the
last part of the value, the end tag and more XML; line 13 is a normal log line.
Expected from SecretTextMasker.maskLines: line 10 ends with ${secret:data.password} after the
start tag, line 11 is empty, line 12 equals </password><mode>basic</mode></login>, line 13 and
every other line are unchanged; 14 lines in and out; no credential-payload-value-0001 left.
Used by SecretTextMaskerLinesTest (tasks.md T013, research D-11).
